# `project.add`

Register a directory as a project (ensures its .ship/ exists).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.projects.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `path` | `string` | yes |
| `name` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

